=== Sherry ===
{{Main|Sherry}}
{{NPCSprite|Sherry}} is an [[NPC]] located right outside '''Sherry's Showroom'''. They offer a shop, containing {{Green|7}} different items, which can be purchased either from {{NPCSprite|Sherry}}'s interface or the displays in the showroom. 

